        Marlin SM2-4.7.2
        Compiled: Jun  3 2024, 17:42:45
        PACKAGE: Snapmaker_V4.7.2
        Module Ver:
        Module 0x00C048D4: v1.14.6
        Module 0x00C02468: v1.14.6
        Module 0x0002C4DE: v1.14.3
        Module 0x00C048D8: v1.14.6
        Module 0x00C048E0: v1.14.6
